{"id":"en_she-kissed-him-with-my-lipstick-on","title":"She Kissed Him With My Lipstick On","titleEn":"She Kissed Him With My Lipstick On","description":"Zara appears to have it all: a billionaire boyfriend named Dylan, a best friend in Megan, and a fashion empire she built herself. That picture shatters on her birthday when she walks in on the two of them kissing in her own bedroom. The betrayal looks deliberate rather than impulsive—Megan is wearing Zara's dress, her perfume, her lipstick, part of what seems to be a calculated plan to replace her. Into this wreckage steps Kade, a dangerous stranger who knows far more than he should, leaving Zara to work out what he actually wants.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/she-kissed-him-with-my-lipstick-on/en_US/aa64878db21a1516/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/she-kissed-him-with-my-lipstick-on/en_US/aa64878db21a1516/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Betrayal","Billionaire","Comeback","Elite","Female","Melodrama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7djqla/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_she-kissed-him-with-my-lipstick-on_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7djqla/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_she-kissed-him-with-my-lipstick-on_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7djqla/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_she-kissed-him-with-my-lipstick-on_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7djqla/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_she-kissed-him-with-my-lipstick-on_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number